        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "What a lovely spa! I was treated to a facial with Mouna and it was probably the best facial I ever experienced. I kept dozing off it was so calming but also didn't want to miss a minute of being pampered, she really took care of my skin I left feeling so relaxed and refreshed. The products used all smelled amazing and left my skin so soft and clear. I will definitely be going back!!",
        "time": 1664579030,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A.P",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110459690590854386246/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz3d2fXGDyR1R4C3bzTiiHMEAvwA7se6XnLNx8E3vQrQ9AXA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "To me she is the best, massage was perfect and so relaxing that I even slept . Optimal amount of pressure on each pain point. I would  definitely recommended her to everyone,  Last year I went to her for first time and since then I always go to her. Believe me if you are looking for a massage give it a try,  I bet you won't regret it, Thanks Monna vous etês super :) !!",
        "time": 1714092560,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Malek T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105982064717912209582/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVGOaK2_VSa3BgYJnrdpXynG_5vNrqZ2M3bJ1WRjPY3HNj1tep=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "What an amazing experience with Mouna. Much better than any 5 star spa. Mouna is very attentive to all that she is doing. I had a facial, wax and pedicure. Was left with a feeling that I was well pampered. She goes the extra 5 steps with every service offering by even blending in a back massage or neck massage during the facial or wax. Top Notch by someone who has been in this line of work for many years and in hi-end spas, she has brought the best of the best to her own spa. Looking forward to going back for other treatments.",
        "time": 1656649569,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Annalene Naicker",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114892894580631249199/reviews",
        "language": "en",
