        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOS6Q2RhZYuSdEBR1VzxFuyz8qQYXpWSC0dnQeTdFqIujSO_n-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "The best spa experience I ever had. Mouna pays attention to details. Her facials are amazing! She takes her time with every service and she personalizes each experience.",
